>I am not sure what to do when somebody's ghost touches you? Do I just
>run away or is there something else I can do? Thanks in advance.
If somebody's ghost touches you, you will only loose some hitpoints. You can
kill the ghost like a normal monster, however it is very difficult to hit a
ghost if you experience less than +/-7. If you can't hit the ghost it is a
good idea to go to the stairs up and wait for the ghost. Go up and the ghost
will follow you. Use the E-word or your relative speed and go down.

Never try to kill a monster that you can't kill at the moment!

